Noam: Okay, do you hear me now?

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Yeah, I can hear you now.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Noam: How are you? What is this nice background? Is that real?

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Carmen Cruickshank: And Israel.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Carmen Cruickshank: It's a lot.

