Noam: Yep.

00:15:11.000 --> 00:15:24.000
Carmen Cruickshank: we do have some… I'm trying to grow more in being a landing page expert, but from the basics I know so far, some of the basics people don't know, and they're, like, are optimizing the logo. But, like, all the basics I know you guys have.

00:15:24.000 --> 00:15:29.000
