Carmen Cruickshank: I think we could just open it again to just see if, maybe if they're coming in the middle of the night, like…

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:59.000
Carmen Cruickshank: and we're restricting it, I think I would just open it again to be 24/7.

00:19:59.000 --> 00:20:03.000
