00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:05.000
Noam: Hmm, I get it.

00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:05.000
Carmen Cruickshank: I don't know.

00:20:05.000 --> 00:20:17.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Yeah, no, I know what you mean. Like, normally, I would be like, this is okay, we don't need this showing in the middle of the night, but before you were getting leads, now you're not. I think I would just test it again at the 24-7.

