Carmen Cruickshank: Yeah, no, you're good.

00:20:52.000 --> 00:21:03.000
Carmen Cruickshank: what to change and what to keep. I think I would keep the budget the same, just because we want to keep it optimized right now, because if we kind of increase it, Google's just, like, scrambling. Um…

00:21:03.000 --> 00:21:14.000
Carmen Cruickshank: but yeah, the only things I would really change is fixing the conversion tracking, so, like, taking out one of the things that we… it could be a repeat conversion tracking, is what I'm saying. Uh…

