Noam: Okay.

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:26.000
Carmen Cruickshank: adding a little bit more buttons for the mobile, and then cutting down some of the keywords and changing it to phrase match, so that way we're getting more relevant traffic. I feel like those 3 things would actually fix things a lot.

00:21:26.000 --> 00:21:35.000
