00:22:14.000 --> 00:22:30.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Oh, okay, that's good. Um, but it's crazy how some small changes can really improve things, because let's say we're getting a lot more clicks for people that are not really searching for what your business is from the broad match, then when we take it down to phrase match, like a good in the middle.

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:42.000
Carmen Cruickshank: then we're spending more money on the people that actually want what you have. And then the people that search on mobile, when they see, like, more of those buttons, they're, like, becoming leads. So it's, like, those small things that really make a big difference.

00:22:34.000 --> 00:22:36.000
Noam: Yeah.

